---
import { v9Href } from '~/data/v9/routes';
---

<section class="g-white" id="lesson">
  <div class="wrap cs-lesson">
    <p data-v9-reveal class="op-q hq">
      “Every step was competent, and the search still took five months.”<cite>From our field note on this search</cite>
    </p>
    <div class="cs-lesson-b">
      <p data-v9-reveal>
        Nobody had done anything wrong. The recruiter sourced well, the panel interviewed properly and the hiring
        manager was engaged throughout. What was missing was a sentence everyone could point to: this is what we are
        deciding.
      </p>
      <p data-v9-reveal>
        The work that fixed it took two days and cost a fixed fee. It’s the reason we won’t start a search before the
        intake conversation has happened.
      </p>
      <p data-v9-reveal class="cs-links">
        <a class="link" href="/blog/why-tech-hiring-really-takes-so-long">Read the field note ›</a><a
          class="link"
          href={v9Href('/__v9/services#sv-scorecard', Astro.url.pathname)}>The role scorecard ›</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
